Ew?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"STX 第一季獲利與營收創紀錄現金流提振獲利能力"},{"title":"Seagate Technology Q1 Earnings Call Highlights","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPcDBxdkt1TkdPUHBMVE5lZTJueWxScUljVmlMWlhaSUlPMDhzUEUwMzdOdElUSkg4NVd2ZjE2VzhEdzZnWmtkb01mOWZFazdocVZmU2huWXlXUlUzUVExWG1iTS1LaVh5T1B4eTlmMV9CYXZBM2ZNMS1UcU16LVpFajU2cDlwQ2JLaGExTVZsR2hvaHVqTjBDVVV2Ykk4dndPR2hfTDYtdzBqdFU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"希捷科技第一季財報電話會議亮點"},{"title":"Seagate Technology Holdings (NASDAQ:STX) Shows High Growth and Improving Fundamentals Across Little Book Criteria","src":"ChartMill","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"希捷科技控股公司（納斯達克股票代碼：STX）在 Little Book Criteria 方面表現出高成長和不斷改善的基本面"},{"title":"Seagate Technology’s Solid Q1 Results Fall Short Of High Expectations; Guidance Reflects ‘Steep Slowdown’","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"希捷科技第一季的穩健業績未達到高預期；指引反映“急劇放緩”"},{"title":"Seagate Technology Holdings PLC Stock (STX) Moved Up by 3.23% on Oct 28: Drivers Behind the Movement","src":"TradingKey","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQcEtvdkF4aDQyNFY3UEFkM0NqN2RoUkNoblBVVHFDWWlHTGg4SVZCNlVJWmtKS0hsQUZMX2licXBNZnRWcl9BMHg5RzFuYzE0SFo5SkI5Z1JLeTRjVEljQVp0cGhRdDdpZWppMjlzeGIxXzhqZHpkX096WWZfRVFHSHFkOGFvS2tEcEE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"希捷科技控股有限公司 (STX) 股票 10 月 28 日上漲 3.23%：走勢背後的驅動因素"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":12},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-04","period":"2026-07-03","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1137789/000113778926000159/stx-20260703.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Seagate is a leading provider of mass-capacity data storage, accelerating the world's ability to harness the full value of data. For nearly 50 years, our portfolio of advanced storage solutions has helped hyperscale, cloud service providers (\"CSPs\"), enterprises and consumers protect, create and manage the data that powers their transformation and growth.","zh":"Seagate 是大容量資料儲存的領先供應商，致力於提高全世界充分利用資料價值的能力。近 50 年來，我們的先進儲存解決方案組合幫助超大規模、雲端服務供應商 (“CSP”)、企業和消費者保護、創建和管理推動其轉型和成長的資料。"},{"en":"Hard disk drives (\"HDDs\") remain a foundational technology for delivering scalable, energy-efficient, mass-capacity storage with favorable storage economics that underpins modern digital infrastructure. Our vertically integrated engineering and manufacturing capabilities, together with continued investment in advanced storage technologies, position us to address customers' evolving storage requirements.","zh":"硬碟（「HDD」）仍然是提供可擴展、節能、大容量儲存的基礎技術，具有良好的儲存經濟性，並支撐著現代數位基礎設施。我們的垂直整​​合工程和製造能力，加上對先進儲存技術的持續投資，使我們能夠滿足客戶不斷變化的儲存需求。"},{"en":"Data Center: Cloud and enterprise environments that rely on scalable, high-capacity storage infrastructure to support AI-enabled computing, business-critical applications and other data-intensive workloads.","zh":"資料中心：依賴可擴展、大容量儲存基礎架構來支援人工智慧運算、關鍵業務應用程式和其他資料密集型工作負載的雲端和企業環境。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our Data Center portfolio includes high-capacity HDDs of up to 44TB and storage systems of up to 3.5PB. These purpose-built solutions are designed to support hyperscale, CSPs, original equipment manufacturers (\"OEMs\") and enterprise organizations, providing scalable storage infrastructure for AI-enabled cloud computing, business-critical applications, content delivery, backup, archive and other large-scale workloads.","zh":"我們的資料中心產品組合包括高達 44TB 的大容量 HDD 和高達 3.5PB 的儲存系統。這些專門建置的解決方案旨在支援超大規模、CSP、原始設備製造商 (“OEM”) 和企業組織，為支援 AI 的雲端運算、關鍵業務應用程式、內容交付、備份、存檔和其他大規模工作負載提供可擴展的儲存基礎架構。"},{"en":"Our Edge IoT portfolio includes storage products ranging from 1TB to 32TB to enable applications where data is created, processed and stored closer to its source. These solutions serve industrial, commercial and consumer environments, supporting video and image applications, network-attached storage (\"NAS\"), smart infrastructure, personal computing, gaming, streaming, creative workflows and data backup.","zh":"我們的邊緣物聯網產品組合包括從 1TB 到 32TB 的儲存產品，支援在更靠近資料來源的地方創建、處理和儲存資料的應用程式。這些解決方案服務於工業、商業和消費環境，支援視訊和影像應用、網路附加儲存（「NAS」）、智慧基礎設施、個人運算、遊戲、串流媒體、創意工作流程和資料備份。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our Data Center portfolio is sold primarily to CSPs, OEMs, distributors and enterprise organizations. These customers deploy our products across cloud and enterprise environments supporting AI-enabled cloud infrastructure, private data centers and other business-critical applications. Many of our major customers, including OEMs and hyperscale cloud operators, purchase products under master purchase agreements, with deliveries scheduled based on customer purchase orders and demand forecasts. To support demand planning and supply predictability for certain products, particularly high-capacity nearline drives, we work with key customers to establish longer-term demand forecasts and supply commitments, including provisions for cancellation charges in certain circumstances.","zh":"我們的資料中心產品組合主要銷售給 CSP、OEM、經銷商和企業組織。這些客戶在雲端和企業環境中部署我們的產品，支援人工智慧雲端基礎架構、私人資料中心和其他關鍵業務應用程式。我們的許多主要客戶，包括原始設備製造商和超大規模雲端營運商，根據主採購協議購買產品，並根據客戶採購訂單和需求預測安排交付。為了支援某些產品（特別是大容量近線驅動器）的需求規劃和供應可預測性，我們與主要客戶合作建立長期需求預測和供應承諾，包括在某些情況下取消費用的規定。"},{"en":"Our Edge IoT products are sold primarily through OEMs, distributors, retailers and third-party resellers serving industrial, commercial and consumer markets. These channels enable us to reach customers across a broad range of edge applications, including video and image, NAS, industrial automation, smart infrastructure and consumer storage. Our distributors operate under non-exclusive agreements that typically include customary sales programs, limited rights of return and price protection provisions. Our retail channel primarily serves casual users, gamers and creative professionals through branded storage products sold directly to retailers or through our distribution partners.","zh":"我們的邊緣物聯網產品主要透過服務工業、商業和消費市場的 OEM、經銷商、零售商和第三方經銷商銷售。這些管道使我們能夠覆蓋廣泛的邊緣應用程式的客戶，包括視訊和圖像、NAS、工業自動化、智慧基礎設施和消費儲存。我們的經銷商根據非排他性協議運營，通常包括慣例銷售計劃、有限退貨權和價格保護條款。我們的零售通路主要透過直接向零售商或透過我們的分銷合作夥伴銷售的品牌儲存產品為休閒用戶、遊戲玩家和創意專業人士提供服務。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our global competitors include HDD manufacturers such as Western Digital Corporation and Toshiba Electronics Devices & Storage Corporation along with NAND flash suppliers that provide and enable alternative storage technologies, as well as storage systems and solutions providers.","zh":"我們的全球競爭對手包括西部資料公司和東芝電子裝置與儲存公司等 HDD 製造商，以及提供和支援替代儲存技術的 NAND 快閃供應商，以及儲存系統和解決方案供應商。"},{"en":"Customers evaluate these solutions based on a variety of factors, including capacity, performance, reliability, product quality, total cost of ownership, energy efficiency, supply continuity, security features, technical support and the ability to meet evolving workload requirements. The relative importance of these factors varies by customer and application.","zh":"客戶根據多種因素評估這些解決方案，包括容量、效能、可靠性、產品品質、整體擁有成本、能源效率、供應連續性、安全功能、技術支援以及滿足不斷變化的工作負載需求的能力。這些因素的相對重要性因客戶和應用而異。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2026-07-03","items":[{"name":"US","val":6146000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"SG","val":4880000000,"zh":"新加坡"},{"name":"NL","val":1165000000,"zh":"荷蘭"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":4000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":12195000000}},"peers":["WDC","SNDK","LRCX","MRVL","LITE"]}}